.TH portensor-scripts-update 1  "update "
.SH NAME
portensor\-scripts\-update \- Update registry\-installed packs using the digest\-pinned lockfile
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBupdate\fR [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fINAME\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update registry\-installed packs using the digest\-pinned lockfile
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<URL>\fR
Use this registry index instead of the source recorded at install time
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fINAME\fR]
Only update this installed pack
